ls -l /etc == 212 entires
ls -l | head == 10 entries bydefaut
ls -l | head -3 == 3 entries from head


ls -l /etc | tail  ==10 entries from bottom

ls -l /etc | tail -50 ==50 entries from bottom


to display lines between 20 to 30   == 30-20 +1 = 10
ls -l /etc | head -30 | tail -10 -- lines between 20 to 30


ls -l /etc | more -> only in forward direction
ls -l /etc | less -> both in forward and bacwad direction

